# NOTE: db/schema/ is deliberately NOT ignored. Confiture builds from DDL, so
# the DDL is the source of truth and lives in the repository — including
# 10_tables/generated.sql, which FraiseQL emits but the example ships, so that
# `confiture build` works on a fresh clone with no code-generation step.

